---
// Standalone concept page — does NOT use the marketing site Layout.
// Lives at bosqueworks.com/concepts/ranch
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow" />
  <title>Concept · A Cow/Calf & Hay Operation · Bosque Works</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,700;1,400&family=Source+Serif+4:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #16201C;
      --bg-deep: #0E1612;
      --bg-warm: #1F2A24;
      --cream: #F5F1E8;
      --rust: #B8552E;
      --sage: #8A9B7A;
      --brass: #C9A961;
      --font-display: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
      --font-body: 'Source Serif 4', 'Source Serif Pro', Georgia, serif;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html {
      scroll-snap-type: y mandatory;
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
      background: var(--bg);
    }
    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--cream);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-weight: 300;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }
    section {
      min-height: 100vh;
      scroll-snap-align: start;
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 5rem 2rem;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .placeholder-label {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 1.75rem;
      right: 1.75rem;
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.35);
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-style: italic;
    }

    /* SECTION 1 — HERO */
    .hero {
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 40% at 50% 90%, rgba(184, 85, 46, 0.35), transparent 65%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 30% at 50% 75%, rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.18), transparent 70%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #0A1310 0%, #1A2520 55%, #2A1A12 100%);
    }
    .hero-content { text-align: center; max-width: 960px; padding: 0 1rem; }
    .hero-eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.45em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--brass);
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      font-style: italic;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 8vw, 6.5rem);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.02;
      margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      color: var(--cream);
    }
    .hero-tagline {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.6vw, 1.35rem);
      max-width: 580px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.78);
      font-style: italic;
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .hero-divider {
      width: 60px;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--brass);
      margin: 2.5rem auto 2.25rem;
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    /* SECTION 2 — THE LAND */
    .land {
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 50% at 75% 30%, rgba(138, 155, 122, 0.18), transparent 65%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 20% 80%, rgba(184, 85, 46, 0.10), transparent 70%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #1A2520 0%, #16201C 100%);
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }
    .land-content {
      max-width: 560px;
      margin-left: clamp(2rem, 10vw, 8rem);
    }

    .section-eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.4em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--rust);
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
      font-style: italic;
    }
    .section-heading {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.25rem);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      color: var(--cream);
      letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    }
    .section-body {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.72);
      line-height: 1.85;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    /* SECTION 3 — WHAT WE RUN */
    .run {
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.025), transparent 70%),
        var(--bg);
    }
    .run-inner {
      max-width: 1200px;
      width: 100%;
    }
    .run-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 5rem;
    }
    .run-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 0;
    }
    .run-col {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
    }
    .run-col + .run-col {
      border-left: 1px solid rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.08);
    }
    .run-col-mark {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--brass);
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
      font-style: italic;
    }
    .run-col-title {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: 1.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      color: var(--cream);
      font-weight: 400;
    }
    .run-col-body {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.62);
      line-height: 1.75;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    /* SECTION 4 — HERITAGE */
    .heritage {
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 40% at 50% 50%, rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.07), transparent 70%),
        var(--bg-deep);
    }
    .heritage-mark {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.45em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--brass);
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      text-align: center;
      font-style: italic;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }
    .heritage-text {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 3.5vw, 2.85rem);
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.45;
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 820px;
      color: var(--cream);
      font-style: italic;
      letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    }
    .heritage-inner {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }

    /* SECTION 5 — CONTACT */
    .contact {
      background: var(--bg);
    }
    .contact-inner {
      text-align: center;
    }
    .contact-eyebrow {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.4em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--rust);
      margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
      font-style: italic;
    }
    .contact-phone {
      font-family: var(--font-display);
      font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5.5vw, 3.75rem);
      color: var(--cream);
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    .contact-meta {
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.55);
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .contact-divider {
      width: 40px;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--brass);
      margin: 1.75rem auto;
      opacity: 0.5;
    }

    /* WATERMARK */
    .built-by {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 1.25rem;
      left: 1.25rem;
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.25em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.4);
      z-index: 100;
      font-style: italic;
    }
    .built-by a {
      color: var(--brass);
      text-decoration: none;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(201, 169, 97, 0.3);
      padding-bottom: 1px;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    .built-by a:hover {
      color: var(--cream);
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      html { scroll-snap-type: none; }
      section { padding: 4rem 1.5rem; }
      .run-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; }
      .run-col { padding: 2.5rem 1rem; }
      .run-col + .run-col {
        border-left: none;
        border-top: 1px solid rgba(245, 241, 232, 0.08);
      }
      .land-content { margin-left: 0; padding: 0 0.5rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-eyebrow">Est. 1952</div>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Iron Creek Ranch</h1>
      <div class="hero-divider"></div>
      <p class="hero-tagline">Working land. Working cattle.<br>Three generations on the same dirt.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="placeholder-label">[Landscape photo: dusk pasture]</div>
  </section>

  <section class="land">
    <div class="land-content">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">The Land</div>
      <h2 class="section-heading">Cross Timbers country, end to end.</h2>
      <p class="section-body">Four hundred acres of native grass and improved coastal along the North Bosque, running back through post oak and mesquite to the bluffs west of Bluff Dale. The Calloway family has run cattle on this ground since Roy Calloway bought his first forty head with wages from the oil fields. Today his grandson runs the same brand on the same land — cow/calf in the bottoms, hay on the flats, and fence and brush work for the neighbors in between.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="placeholder-label">[Landscape photo: pasture and oak]</div>
  </section>

  <section class="run">
    <div class="run-inner">
      <div class="run-header">
        <div class="section-eyebrow">What We Run</div>
        <h2 class="section-heading">Three operations. One outfit.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="run-grid">
        <div class="run-col">
          <div class="run-col-mark">— I —</div>
          <h3 class="run-col-title">Cow/Calf</h3>
          <p class="run-col-body">Mama cows and weaned calves, raised on grass and worked the way they ought to be. Sale-ready in the fall.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="run-col">
          <div class="run-col-mark">— II —</div>
          <h3 class="run-col-title">Custom Hay</h3>
          <p class="run-col-body">Coastal and sudan, cut and baled on schedule. Round and square. We come to your fields.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="run-col">
          <div class="run-col-mark">— III —</div>
          <h3 class="run-col-title">Ag Services</h3>
          <p class="run-col-body">Fence work, brush clearing, and pasture spraying for neighbors who'd rather hire it done right than do it twice.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="heritage">
    <div class="heritage-inner">
      <div class="heritage-mark">— Heritage —</div>
      <p class="heritage-text">Three generations. One brand.<br>The same land since 1952.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact">
    <div class="contact-inner">
      <div class="contact-eyebrow">Get in Touch</div>
      <div class="contact-phone">(254) 555-0187</div>
      <div class="contact-divider"></div>
      <div class="contact-meta">Erath County · Texas</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="built-by">
    Concept by <a href="https://bosqueworks.com">Bosque Works</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
